The ReSTIR story's importance sampling on P's lights
====================================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 2's beats `c2-is-math` and `c2-ris-question`,
stage by stage as `isStage` goes from 0 to 14: each light of the math scenes' example world (examples.rs, the lab's
illustration: 24 lights above P, every one reaching it) as a pair of bars, above what it brings to P, below the
chance the cheap choice picks it (its share of the power); a light drawn and its estimate f / p on a line of estimates around the true total; p reshaped
toward f until every estimate is the total; two ways of drawing mixed with weights that sum to one; then the target,
its total, and the cheap choice that ignores P. The numbers are the example's (`exampleLights`): its lights move
and brighten as the story's cues move the room's (`lightPhase`, `lightIntensity`).

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The charts

The bars run across the left of the canvas, f above and p below, one slot per light.
$[# _x0 -6.4]
$[# _x1 2.2]
$[# _fBase 0.9]
$[# _pBase -1.7]
$[# _lineY -2.9]
$[# _lineX0 -6.4]
$[# _lineX1 2.2]
$[# _right [% {v2 5.2 0.0}]]

Fn([Int, Int], Box). The slot of light i of n, across the bars' width, from a baseline of height 0.
$[# {_slot i n}
    [# w {/ {- _x1 _x0} {float n}}]
    [# x {+ _x0 {* w {float i}}}]
    {box {v2 {+ x {* 0.15 w}} 0.0} {v2 {- {+ x w} {* 0.15 w}} 0.0}}]
Fn([String, Int, Int, Float, Float, String, Float], List(Mob)). Light i's bar on the baseline `base`, `height` high.
$[# {_bar id i n base height color alpha}
    [# s {_slot i n}]
    {filled id
        {box {v2 {.x {.lo s}} base} {v2 {.x {.hi s}} {+ base {max height 0.0}}}}
        color
        alpha}]

Fn([List({brings: Float, share: Float})], Float). The total of what the lights bring.
$[# {_total lights} {fold lights 0.0 {^ {t l} {+ t {.brings l}}}}]
Fn([List({brings: Float, share: Float})], Float). The largest share.
$[# {_maxShare lights} {fold lights 0.000001 {^ {m l} {max m {.share l}}}}]

Fn([List(Float), Float], Int). The light a uniform number `u` picks by the shares' running sum (as the lab's CDF and
binary search do, cpu.rs `Scene::pick`).
$[# {_pick shares u}
    [# starts {runningSums shares}]
    [# n {length shares}]
    {fold
        {range 0 n}
        {- n 1}
        {^ {found i} {!if {!and {= found {- n 1}} {< u {nth starts {+ i 1}}}}
            {min found i}
            found}}}]

The story's draws: eight lights picked by the cheap choice with the story's numbers.
$[# _draws 8]



The scene



A light drawn (stage 0 to 2): the first draw's bars lit, a marker above it, and its estimate written f / p.
$[# {_drawn s draws brings pNow fHeight pHeight n}
    [# i {head draws}]
    [# away {- 1.0 {smooth {phase s 5.6 6.0}}}]
    [# slot {_slot i n}]
    [# x {.x {boxCenter slot}}]
    [# marker {append
        {arrowLine "drawn"
            {v2 x 3.85}
            {v2 x {+ _fBase {+ {fHeight {nth brings i}} 0.1}}}
            accentColor
            3.0}
        {append
            {_bar "drawnF" i n _fBase {fHeight {nth brings i}} accentColor 1.0}
            {_bar "drawnP" i n _pBase {pHeight {nth pNow i}} accentColor 1.0}}}]
    [# f {nth brings i}]
    [# p {nth pNow i}]
    [# formula {moveTo
        {texParts "est" f"{\frac{\lit{1}{f(x)}}{\lit{2}{p(x)}} = \frac{\lit{3}{${short f}}}{\lit{4}{${short p}}} = \lit{5}{${short {over f p}}}}" 0.48 textColor
            {' "f" "p" "fv" "pv" "e"}
            {' targetColor pColor targetColor pColor estimateColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 2.4}}}]
    {!if {< s 0.6}
        {'}
        {faded {append {fadeIn {phase s 0.6 1.0} marker} {write {phase s 1.0 1.8} formula}} away}}]

The line of estimates (stages 1 to 5): each draw's estimate f / p as a dot (the first at stage 1, the others at 2),
the true total marked, the dots sliding as p follows f (stage 3 to 4) and back; a dot fades as its light's p goes
to nothing (it would never be drawn).
$[# {_estimates s draws brings pNow shares total}
    [# far {* 4.0 total}]
    [# {_x e} {lerp _lineX0 _lineX1 {clamp {/ e far} 0.0 1.0}}]
    [# away {- 1.0 {smooth {phase s 5.0 5.5}}}]
    [# line {append
        {arrowLine "line" {v2 _lineX0 _lineY} {v2 {+ _lineX1 0.3} _lineY} textDimColor 2.0}
        {moveTo {tex "lineLabel" f"{\frac{f}{p}}" 0.4 estimateColor} {v2 {+ _lineX1 0.8} _lineY}}}]
    [# truth {append
        {dashedLine "truth"
            {v2 {_x total} {- _lineY 0.35}}
            {v2 {_x total} {+ _lineY 0.6}}
            totalColor
            2.5}
        {moveTo
            {tex "truthText" f"{\textstyle\sum f}" 0.4 totalColor}
            {v2 {_x total} {- _lineY 0.7}}}}]
    [# dots {map
        {range 0 _draws}
        {^ {j}
            [# i {nth draws j}]
            [# p {nth pNow i}]
            [# seen {clamp {/ p {max {nth shares i} 0.000001}} 0.0 1.0}]
            [# e {over {nth brings i} p}]
            [# r {+ 0.07 {* 0.25 {sqrt {nth shares i}}}}]
            [# dot {dotAt f"{dot${str j}}" {v2 {_x e} _lineY} r estimateColor}]
            {faded
                {fadeIn
                    {!if {= j 0}
                        {phase s 1.4 1.8}
                        {phase s {+ 2.0 {* 0.08 {float j}}} {+ 2.3 {* 0.08 {float j}}}}}
                    dot}
                {min seen 1.0}}}}]
    {!if {< s 1.0}
        {'}
        {faded
            {flatten {'
                {create {phase s 1.0 1.4} line}
                {fadeIn {phase s 2.0 2.4} truth}
                {flatten dots}}}
            away}}]

Mixing two ways of drawing (stages 4 to 6): a second way, every light alike, shown flat over the p bars, and each
light's two weights stacked to one (the balance heuristic's, one choice of weights that sum to one).
$[# {_mixing s shares fHeight pHeight n}
    [# show {- {smooth {phase s 5.0 5.5}} {smooth {phase s 6.0 6.4}}}]
    [# flat {/ 1.0 {float n}}]
    [# flatLine {dashedLine "flat"
        {v2 _x0 {+ _pBase {pHeight flat}}}
        {v2 _x1 {+ _pBase {pHeight flat}}}
        textColor
        2.0}]
    [# base -3.5]
    [# stacks {flatten {map
        {range 0 n}
        {^ {i}
            [# p {nth shares i}]
            [# m {/ p {+ p flat}}]
            [# slot {_slot i n}]
            {append
                {filled f"{m1${str i}}"
                    {box {v2 {.x {.lo slot}} base} {v2 {.x {.hi slot}} {+ base m}}}
                    pColor
                    0.85}
                {filled f"{m2${str i}}"
                    {box {v2 {.x {.lo slot}} {+ base m}} {v2 {.x {.hi slot}} {+ base 1.0}}}
                    textDimColor
                    0.6}}}}}]
    [# formula {moveTo
        {tex "mis" f"{m_1(x) + m_2(x) = 1}" 0.44 textColor}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -3.0}}}]
    {!if {<= show 0.0}
        {'}
        {faded
            {flatten {'
                {create {phase s 5.0 5.4} flatLine}
                {growFrom {phase s 5.4 5.9} stacks down}
                {write {phase s 5.5 5.9} formula}}}
            show}}]

The target (stages 10 to 13): the totals (the target's is not one), and the exact proportion struck out. (The
ideal p, f's shares, is the p bars reshaped and in the target's colour, stages 6 to 12; the cheap choice's p is kept
while P's bars become another pixel's, stage 12.)
$[# {_target s total}
    [# sums {flatten {'
        {moveTo
            {tex "sumF" f"{\textstyle\sum \hat p = ${short total}}" 0.44 targetColor}
            {add2 _right {v2 0.0 2.3}}}
        {moveTo {tex "sumP" f"{\textstyle\sum p = 1}" 0.44 pColor} {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -0.9}}}}}]
    [# exact {moveTo
        {texParts "exact" f"{\frac{\hat p(x)}{\lit{1}{\textstyle\sum \hat p}}}" 0.5 textColor
            {' "sum"}
            {' targetColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 0.8}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {!if {< s 10.0} {'} {fadeOut {phase s 12.6 13.0} {write {phase s 10.0 10.7} sums}}}
        {!if {< s 11.0}
            {'}
            {fadeOut
                {phase s 12.6 13.0}
                {crossParts
                    {phase s 11.5 11.9}
                    {write {phase s 11.0 11.5} exact}
                    {' "sum"}
                    weightColor}}}}}]

Fn([Float, List({brings: Float, share: Float}), List({brings: Float, share: Float})], List(Mob)). The scene once
the frame has P's and Q's lights.
$[# {_scene s atP atQ}
    [# n {length atP}]
    [# shares {map atP .share}]
    [# toQ {smooth {phase s 12.0 12.6}}]
    [# brings {map {range 0 n} {^ {i} {lerp {.brings {nth atP i}} {.brings {nth atQ i}} toQ}}}]
    [# total {fold {map atP .brings} 0.0 +}]
    [# unit {/ {fold {map atP .brings} 0.000001 max} {max {lightIntensity} 0.01}}]
    [# fHeight {^ {f} {min 2.6 {* 1.8 {/ f unit}}}}]
    [# ideal {- {smooth {phase s 6.0 6.6}} {smooth {phase s 11.5 12.0}}}]
    [# toF {+ {- {smooth {phase s 3.0 3.7}} {smooth {phase s 4.0 4.6}}} ideal}]
    [# pNow {map {range 0 n} {^ {i} {lerp {nth shares i} {over {nth brings i} total} toF}}}]
    [# pMax {fold pNow 0.000001 max}]
    [# pHeight {^ {p} {* 1.6 {/ p pMax}}}]
    [# draws {map {range 0 _draws} {^ {j} {_pick shares {uniform 11 j}}}}]
    [# fBars {flatten {map
        {range 0 n}
        {^ {i} {_bar f"{f${str i}}" i n _fBase {fHeight {nth brings i}} targetColor 0.85}}}}]
    [# pBars {flatten {map
        {range 0 n}
        {^ {i} {_bar f"{p${str i}}" i n _pBase {pHeight {nth pNow i}} pColor 0.85}}}}]
    [# idealBars {faded {tinted pBars targetColor} {* 0.9 ideal}}]
    [# fLabel {transform
        {phase s 8.0 8.6}
        {moveTo {tex "fLabel" "f" 0.5 targetColor} {v2 -6.9 {+ _fBase 0.9}}}
        {moveTo {tex "fLabel" f"{\hat p}" 0.5 targetColor} {v2 -6.9 {+ _fBase 0.9}}}}]
    [# pLabel {moveTo {tex "pLabel" "p" 0.5 pColor} {v2 -6.9 {+ _pBase 0.8}}}]
    [# where {transform
        {phase s 12.0 12.6}
        {moveTo {caption "whereP" {textKey "lightsmath-pixel-p"} 0.32 textDimColor} {v2 -5.4 3.75}}
        {moveTo
            {caption "whereP" {textKey "lightsmath-pixel-q"} 0.32 textDimColor}
            {v2 -4.6 3.75}}}]
    [# barsNote {moveTo
        {caption "barsNote" {textKey "lightsmath-bars"} 0.3 textDimColor}
        {v2 -1.7 {- _pBase 0.35}}}]
    [# charts {flatten {'
        {growFrom {phase s 0.0 0.5} fBars down}
        {growFrom {phase s 0.2 0.7} {faded pBars {- 1.0 ideal}} down}
        idealBars
        {fadeIn
            {phase s 0.0 0.4}
            {flatten {'
                {pointParts {phase s 7.0 8.0} fLabel {' "fLabel"} accentColor}
                pLabel
                where
                barsNote}}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        charts
        {_drawn s draws brings pNow fHeight pHeight n}
        {_estimates s draws brings pNow shares total}
        {_mixing s shares fHeight pHeight n}
        {_target s total}
        {drop {circumscribe {phase s 13.0 14.0} {append pBars pLabel} accentColor} {+ n 1}}}}]


The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). P's lights at stage `isStage`.
$[# lightsMath {: {^ {t}
    [# s {isStage}]
    [# atP {exampleLights 0 {lightPhase} {lightIntensity}}]
    [# atQ {exampleLights 1 {lightPhase} {lightIntensity}}]
    {_scene s atP atQ}} Math}]
